    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quibi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A shooting video game, but with a little story to tell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.poster.avif?t=1743432815\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.webm?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.mp4?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We'll have a cute cube-shaped companion who will have to rescue his beloved. He'll discover a new place, and all he wants is for her to be reunited with his entire family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be music to liven up the destruction of enemies, and music that you might find entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be different scenaries where you can fight enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 stages. Different enemies to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.poster.avif?t=1743432815\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.webm?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.mp4?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight to the end and don't give up </i></strong>Love can always triumph...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quibi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A shooting video game, but with a little story to tell.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.poster.avif?t=1743432815\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.webm?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/f44fe0bfd3fe0819ec59c6937580696b.mp4?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We'll have a cute cube-shaped companion who will have to rescue his beloved. He'll discover a new place, and all he wants is for her to be reunited with his entire family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be music to liven up the destruction of enemies, and music that you might find entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be different scenaries where you can fight enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 5 stages. Different enemies to fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.poster.avif?t=1743432815\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.webm?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585740/extras/cc052a9f9a9dbcd251cd41b9ddeb7099.mp4?t=1743432815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight to the end and don't give up </i></strong>Love can always triumph...</p>",
